cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "geospatial-fm-reliability-research: geographic coverage debt of frozen Earth-observation foundation models and conditional conformal repair"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Fu"
    given-names: "Zeyu"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8329-0108"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-02"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21130299"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Experiment code, cached frozen-encoder features metadata, and manuscript for a
  study of conformal-prediction coverage loss of frozen geospatial foundation
  models (Prithvi-EO-2.0-300M, Clay v1.5, SSL4EO-S12 DINO/MAE) under a real
  East-to-West Europe geographic shift, with a conditional, encoder-dependent
  target-side conformal repair, boundary-sensitivity sweep, label-access
  ablation, and GEO-Bench m-bigearthnet multi-label + CRC replication.
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - calibration
  - geospatial foundation models
  - distribution shift
  - Earth observation
